# Telivi PRD

[docs/PRD.md](../../docs/PRD.md) is the source of truth for what Telivi is.

- Read it before proposing or writing implementation.
- Do not add training code, a model architecture, or dependencies until an issue asks for them.
- Ownership means both things: a person is named on the weights they change, and people who lend compute hold a stake in the model.
